---
layout: base.njk
---
<section class="intro" aria-labelledby="site-title">
  <div class="intro-copy">
    <h1 id="site-title">{{ site.title }}</h1>
    <p>I write about how AI systems build and use interfaces, and how we can evaluate and train those capabilities.</p>
  </div>
  <img class="intro-image" src="/assets/interface-study.webp" alt="" width="960" height="720" fetchpriority="high">
</section>
<div class="index-grid">
  <section class="article-index" id="articles" aria-labelledby="articles-title">
    <h2 id="articles-title">Writing</h2>
    {% if collections.posts.length %}
      <ol class="article-list">
        {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
          <li>
            <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | displayDate }}</time>
            <div>
              <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title | escape }}</a></h3>
              {% if post.data.description %}<p>{{ post.data.description | escape }}</p>{% endif %}
            </div>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    {% else %}
      <p class="empty">No articles yet. <a href="/feed.xml">Subscribe via RSS</a> for new posts.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </section>
  <aside class="topics" aria-labelledby="topics-title">
    <h2 id="topics-title">Research interests</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>GUI agents</li>
      <li>Interface generation and aesthetics</li>
      <li>LLM evaluation and post-training</li>
      <li>Agentic reinforcement learning</li>
    </ul>
  </aside>
</div>
